---
// 根目錄重定向頁面 - 移植相鄰專案的強化語言偵測（無語言選擇 UI，失敗時 fallback 到 en）
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
        <title>Redirecting | Seasalt.ai</title>
        <meta
            name="description"
            content="Redirecting to your preferred language..."
        />

        <!-- Canonical URL -->
        <link rel="canonical" href="https://seasalt.ai/en/" />

        <!-- 預加載最可能的語言頁面 -->
        <link rel="preload" href="/en/" as="document" />

        <!-- Hreflang 標籤 -->
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://seasalt.ai/en/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="es" href="https://seasalt.ai/es/" />
        <link
            rel="alternate"
            hreflang="zh-TW"
            href="https://seasalt.ai/zh-TW/"
        />
        <link
            rel="alternate"
            hreflang="zh-CN"
            href="https://seasalt.ai/zh-CN/"
        />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ja" href="https://seasalt.ai/ja/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ko" href="https://seasalt.ai/ko/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="fr" href="https://seasalt.ai/fr/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="de" href="https://seasalt.ai/de/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ar" href="https://seasalt.ai/ar/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="fa" href="https://seasalt.ai/fa/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="fil" href="https://seasalt.ai/fil/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="hi" href="https://seasalt.ai/hi/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="id" href="https://seasalt.ai/id/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ms" href="https://seasalt.ai/ms/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="pl" href="https://seasalt.ai/pl/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="pt" href="https://seasalt.ai/pt/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ru" href="https://seasalt.ai/ru/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ta" href="https://seasalt.ai/ta/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="th" href="https://seasalt.ai/th/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="vi" href="https://seasalt.ai/vi/" />
        <link rel="alternate" hreflang="ro" href="https://seasalt.ai/ro/" />
        <link
            rel="alternate"
            hreflang="x-default"
            href="https://seasalt.ai/en/"
        />

        <!-- 強化語言偵測與任意路徑重導向（支援 sessionStorage redirectPath/spa_redirect） -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                // 支援的語言列表（需與 astro.config.mjs 同步）
                const supportedLocales = [
                    "en",
                    "es",
                    "zh-TW",
                    "zh-CN",
                    "ja",
                    "ko",
                    "fr",
                    "de",
                    "ar",
                    "fa",
                    "fil",
                    "hi",
                    "id",
                    "ms",
                    "pl",
                    "pt",
                    "ru",
                    "ta",
                    "th",
                    "vi",
                    "ro",
                ];

                // 語言映射表（瀏覽器/地區變體 → 專案語言碼）
                const languageMap = {
                    "zh-Hans": "zh-CN",
                    "zh-Hant": "zh-TW",
                    "zh-HK": "zh-TW",
                    "zh-MO": "zh-TW",
                    "zh-SG": "zh-CN",
                    zh: "zh-TW",
                    "fil-PH": "fil",
                    tl: "fil",
                    "fa-IR": "fa",
                    "ms-MY": "ms",
                    "ta-IN": "ta",
                    "hi-IN": "hi",
                    "id-ID": "id",
                    "th-TH": "th",
                    "vi-VN": "vi",
                };

                // 時區 → 語言推測（簡化版）
                const timezoneToLanguage = {
                    "Asia/Tokyo": "ja",
                    "Asia/Seoul": "ko",
                    "Asia/Shanghai": "zh-CN",
                    "Asia/Hong_Kong": "zh-TW",
                    "Asia/Taipei": "zh-TW",
                    "Asia/Singapore": "zh-CN",
                    "Asia/Bangkok": "th",
                    "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh": "vi",
                    "Asia/Jakarta": "id",
                    "Asia/Kuala_Lumpur": "ms",
                    "Asia/Manila": "fil",
                    "Asia/Kolkata": "hi",
                    "Asia/Karachi": "hi",
                    "Asia/Tehran": "fa",
                    "Asia/Dubai": "ar",
                    "Asia/Riyadh": "ar",
                    "Europe/London": "en",
                    "Europe/Berlin": "de",
                    "Europe/Paris": "fr",
                    "Europe/Madrid": "es",
                    "Europe/Rome": "es",
                    "Europe/Warsaw": "pl",
                    "Europe/Moscow": "ru",
                    "America/New_York": "en",
                    "America/Los_Angeles": "en",
                    "America/Chicago": "en",
                    "America/Toronto": "en",
                    "America/Mexico_City": "es",
                    "America/Sao_Paulo": "pt",
                    "Australia/Sydney": "en",
                    "Africa/Cairo": "ar",
                };

                function isSupportedLocale(code) {
                    return supportedLocales.includes(code);
                }

                function detectLanguage() {
                    const urlParams = new URLSearchParams(
                        window.location.search
                    );
                    const debug = urlParams.get("debug") === "1";
                    const log = [];

                    // 1) URL 參數
                    const urlLang = urlParams.get("lang");
                    if (urlLang && isSupportedLocale(urlLang)) {
                        log.push(`URL param: ${urlLang}`);
                        debug && console.log(log.join("\n"));
                        return urlLang;
                    }

                    // 2) localStorage 偏好
                    try {
                        const savedLang = localStorage.getItem(
                            "seasalt-preferred-language"
                        );
                        if (savedLang && isSupportedLocale(savedLang)) {
                            log.push(`Saved preference: ${savedLang}`);
                            debug && console.log(log.join("\n"));
                            return savedLang;
                        }
                    } catch {}

                    // 3) 瀏覽器語言清單
                    const browserLangs = navigator.languages || [
                        navigator.language || navigator.userLanguage,
                    ];
                    for (const browserLang of browserLangs) {
                        const normalized = String(browserLang || "").trim();
                        const lower = normalized.toLowerCase();

                        if (isSupportedLocale(lower)) {
                            log.push(`Browser direct: ${lower}`);
                            debug && console.log(log.join("\n"));
                            return lower;
                        }
                        if (languageMap[normalized]) {
                            const mapped = languageMap[normalized];
                            if (isSupportedLocale(mapped)) {
                                log.push(
                                    `Browser mapped: ${normalized} → ${mapped}`
                                );
                                debug && console.log(log.join("\n"));
                                return mapped;
                            }
                        }
                        const prefix = lower.split("-")[0];
                        if (isSupportedLocale(prefix)) {
                            log.push(`Browser prefix: ${lower} → ${prefix}`);
                            debug && console.log(log.join("\n"));
                            return prefix;
                        }
                        if (prefix === "zh") {
                            const zh =
                                lower.includes("cn") || lower.includes("hans")
                                    ? "zh-CN"
                                    : "zh-TW";
                            log.push(`Browser zh variant: ${lower} → ${zh}`);
                            debug && console.log(log.join("\n"));
                            return zh;
                        }
                    }

                    // 4) 時區推測
                    try {
                        const tz =
                            Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions().timeZone;
                        const tzLang = timezoneToLanguage[tz];
                        if (tzLang && isSupportedLocale(tzLang)) {
                            log.push(`Timezone: ${tz} → ${tzLang}`);
                            debug && console.log(log.join("\n"));
                            return tzLang;
                        }
                    } catch {}

                    // 5) 預設英文
                    log.push("Fallback: en");
                    debug && console.log(log.join("\n"));
                    return "en";
                }

                function buildRedirectTarget(preferredLang) {
                    // 支援 404.html 的回跳（目前專案使用 redirectPath，相鄰專案使用 spa_redirect）
                    // 另外也支援 404 透過 ?p= 傳遞完整路徑，避免某些環境下 sessionStorage 取不到
                    const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
                    const paramPath = params.get("p");
                    const saved =
                        sessionStorage.getItem("redirectPath") ||
                        sessionStorage.getItem("spa_redirect") ||
                        (paramPath ? decodeURIComponent(paramPath) : "/") ||
                        "/";

                    let originalPath =
                        typeof saved === "string" && saved.length > 0
                            ? saved
                            : "/";

                    // 若誤傳了絕對 URL，轉回相對路徑（只保留 path + query + hash）
                    try {
                        if (/^https?:/i.test(originalPath)) {
                            const u = new URL(
                                originalPath,
                                window.location.origin
                            );
                            originalPath =
                                (u.pathname || "/") +
                                (u.search || "") +
                                (u.hash || "");
                        }
                    } catch {}

                    // 標準化
                    if (!originalPath.startsWith("/"))
                        originalPath = "/" + originalPath;

                    // 若原始就是根 /，直接導到 /{lang}/
                    if (originalPath === "/") {
                        return `/${preferredLang}/`;
                    }

                    // 判斷第一段是否已是語言碼
                    const parts = originalPath.split("/").filter(Boolean);
                    const first = (parts[0] || "").toLowerCase();
                    if (isSupportedLocale(first)) {
                        // 已含語言前綴，尊重原始路徑
                        return originalPath;
                    }

                    // 否則加上語言前綴
                    return `/${preferredLang}${originalPath}`;
                }

                const detectedLang = detectLanguage();
                const target = buildRedirectTarget(detectedLang);

                // 保存偏好語言
                try {
                    localStorage.setItem(
                        "seasalt-preferred-language",
                        detectedLang
                    );
                } catch {}

                // 清理暫存路徑
                try {
                    sessionStorage.removeItem("redirectPath");
                    sessionStorage.removeItem("spa_redirect");
                } catch {}

                // 立即重導向
                window.location.replace(target);
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- SEO 友好的 noscript 回退 -->
        <noscript>
            <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/en/" />
        </noscript>
    </head>
    <body>
        <!-- 載入指示器 -->
        <div
            id="redirect-container"
            style="
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #e4edf5 100%);
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, 'Open Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
        transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    "
        >
            <div
                style="
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 400px;
            padding: 2rem;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
        "
            >
                <div
                    style="
                width: 60px;
                height: 60px;
                margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
                position: relative;
            "
                >
                    <div
                        style="
                    position: absolute;
                    top: 0;
                    left: 0;
                    width: 100%;
                    height: 100%;
                    border: 4px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
                    border-top: 4px solid #3B82F6;
                    border-radius: 50%;
                    animation: spin 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.5, 0, 0.5, 1) infinite;
                    box-sizing: border-box;
                "
                    >
                    </div>
                    <div
                        style="
                    position: absolute;
                    top: 50%;
                    left: 50%;
                    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
                    width: 20px;
                    height: 20px;
                    background: #3B82F6;
                    border-radius: 50%;
                    opacity: 0.8;
                "
                    >
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h1
                    style="
                font-size: 1.5rem;
                font-weight: 600;
                color: #1f2937;
                margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
                letter-spacing: -0.025em;
            "
                >
                    Redirecting...
                </h1>

                <p
                    style="
                color: #6b7280;
                margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
                font-size: 1rem;
                line-height: 1.5;
            "
                >
                    We're taking you to the best version of our site for your
                    language and region.
                </p>

                <div
                    style="
                display: flex;
                justify-content: center;
                gap: 0.5rem;
                font-size: 0.875rem;
                color: #9ca3af;
            "
                >
                    <span style="opacity: 0.7;">Detecting</span>
                    <span style="opacity: 0.7;">•</span>
                    <span style="opacity: 0.7;">Redirecting</span>
                    <span style="opacity: 0.7;">•</span>
                    <span style="opacity: 0.7;">Loading</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <style>
            @keyframes spin {
                0% {
                    transform: rotate(0deg);
                }
                100% {
                    transform: rotate(360deg);
                }
            }

            body {
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                overflow-x: hidden;
            }

            /* Smooth fade out when redirect happens */
            body.redirecting #redirect-container {
                opacity: 0;
                pointer-events: none;
            }
        </style>
        <script>
            // Add redirecting class to body to trigger fade-out animation
            setTimeout(() => {
                document.body.classList.add("redirecting");
            }, 500);
        </script>
    </body>
</html>
